data/
/src/popoto/_archive/
.claude/hooks/
.claude/worktrees/
# The SDLC pipeline creates worktrees here too. Untracked, these get swept in
# by `git add -A` as embedded-repo gitlinks — five of them landed in a commit
# on this branch before being caught.
.worktrees/

# Same hazard, same cause: the pipeline writes a scratch task list here, and
# removing this line to keep an unrelated change out of a behavior PR is
# precisely how a stale copy got committed on PR #601.
PROGRESS.md
